1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,533
In Spell 125,
the dead person lists

2
00:00:03,533 --> 00:00:05,767
the wrongs they never did.

3
00:00:05,767 --> 00:00:07,500
I have not stolen.

4
00:00:07,500 --> 00:00:11,333
Then they greet forty-two gods,
each by name.

5
00:00:11,333 --> 00:00:12,733
Could you fail?

6
00:00:12,733 --> 00:00:15,000
Papyri made to help
the dead live on

7
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:18,133
are unlikely to show
their owner being devoured.
